  "worked_solution": "Diagonals join non-adjacent vertices.\n\nTherefore, the diagonals of the polygon are $\\overset{―}{AC},\\,\\overset{―}{AD},\\,\\overset{―}{BD},\\,\\overset{―}{BE}$ and $\\overset{―}{CE}.$ Of all these, the diagonal $\\overset{―}{CE}$ was not drawn on the polygon.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133876/assets/15154f866047ab378947f39273c8cc5aaf30c62b6eac21b305e04b06a3f2eb61.png)",
